{"folioDeck": 1, "exportedAt": 1793318400000, "meta": {"id": "jahira", "title": "Japanese — Hiragana", "subtitle": "The 105 hiragana — start here, before any word", "desc": "The first thing to learn in Japanese, before any word: hiragana, the syllabary Japanese uses for its grammar — particles, verb endings — and for words with no kanji, and the script of every reading. 105 notes, each with TWO cards (hiragana → romaji, romaji → hiragana), each scheduled on its own: the 46 of the basic chart, the 25 voiced with ゛ and ゜, the 33 combinations with a small ゃ, ゅ or ょ, and the small っ that doubles a consonant. The romaji is Hepburn. Three sounds are written two ways (じ and ぢ, ず and づ, お and を), and the card for the rarer one says which it asks for. Each card shows the matching katakana and a word that begins with the kana, taken from the JLPT N5 and N4 decks, with its reading and meaning. Study before JLPT N5. — Example words: Jonathan Waller's JLPT lists (CC BY) and JMdict (EDRDG, CC BY-SA 4.0), furigana JmdictFurigana (CC BY-SA 4.0).", "author": "", "language": "en", "color": "#BC002D", "tags": ["japanese", "hiragana", "kana", "writing"], "glossMode": "site", "types": {"kana": {"id": "kana", "name": "Japanese kana", "speechLang": "ja-JP", "fields": ["Kana", "Romaji", "Note", "Pair", "Examples"], "cards": [{"name": "Hiragana → romaji", "front": "<div class=\"uc-kana\">{{Kana}}</div>", "back": "{{FrontSide}}<hr><div class=\"uc-romaji\">{{Romaji}}<span class=\"uc-tts uc-say\" data-say=\"{{Kana}}\"></span></div>{{#Note}}<div class=\"uc-note\">{{Note}}</div>{{/Note}}{{#Pair}}<div class=\"uc-pair\">{{Pair}}</div>{{/Pair}}{{#Examples}}<div class=\"uc-eg\">{{Examples}}</div>{{/Examples}}"}, {"name": "Romaji → hiragana", "front": "<div class=\"uc-ask\">Write it in hiragana</div><div class=\"uc-romaji\">{{Romaji}}</div>{{#Note}}<div class=\"uc-note\">{{Note}}</div>{{/Note}}", "back": "{{FrontSide}}<hr><div class=\"uc-kana\">{{Kana}}<span class=\"uc-tts uc-say\" data-say=\"{{Kana}}\"></span></div>{{#Pair}}<div class=\"uc-pair\">{{Pair}}</div>{{/Pair}}{{#Examples}}<div class=\"uc-eg\">{{Examples}}</div>{{/Examples}}"}], "css": ".card { text-align: center; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }\n.uc-ask { margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.55; }\n.uc-kana { font-size: 72px; line-height: 1.2; }\n.uc-say { margin-left: 14px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 15px; }\n.uc-romaji { font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }\n.uc-note { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.65; }\n.uc-pair { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.75; }\n.uc-pair b { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin-left: 6px; }\n.uc-eg { margin: 14px auto 0; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; padding: 9px 15px; border: 1px solid var(--rule, rgba(0,0,0,0.12)); border-radius: 11px; }\n.uc-egl { display: block; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.55; }\n.uc-egw { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.7; }\n.uc-egw rt { font-size: 0.45em; opacity: 0.75; }\n.uc-egr { font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; opacity: 0.7; }\n.uc-egg { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.62; }\n"}}, "version": 1, "createdAt": 1793318400000, "updatedAt": 1793318400000, "forkedFrom": null}, "cards": [{"id": "u_jahira_1", "num": "1", "type": "kana", "fields": {"Kana": "あ", "Romaji": "a", "Note": "", "Pair": "in katakana <b>ア</b>", "Examples": "<span class=\"uc-egl\">as in</span><div class=\"uc-egw\"><b>あ</b>る</div><div class=\"uc-egr\">aru</div><div class=\"uc-egg\">to be</div>"}}, {"id": "u_jahira_2", "num": "2", "type": "kana", "fields": {"Kana": "い", "Romaji": "i", "Note": "", "Pair": "in katakana <b>イ</b>", "Examples": "<span class=\"uc-egl\">as in</span><div class=\"uc-egw\"><b>い</b>る</div><div class=\"uc-egr\">iru</div><div class=\"uc-egg\">to be (of animate objects)</div>"}}, {"id": "u_jahira_3", "num": "3", "type": "kana", "fields": {"Kana": "う", "Romaji": "u", "Note": "", "Pair": "in ka